{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1403661-v20-necromancy","id":1403661,"title":"[V20] Necromancy","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-07-20T07:15:23-07:00","id":1403661,"title":"[V20] Necromancy","content":"Dear All,<br /> <br /> here below some doubts about some Necromancy Powers:<br /> 1. Rigor Mortis - is the target able to break the power every round or first round only?<br /> 2. Hand glory - what is the humans Reaction? Any roll for Not sleeping or all humans sleep after the hand is activated?<br /> <br /> Any suggestion will be appreciated. Any suggestion who and where I can collect info/suggestions will be appreciated too.<br /> <br /> thanks a lot in advance<br /> JLW","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25452-dras76","name":"dras76","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25452_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-22T03:49:45-07:00","id":1403970,"title":"","content":"1) As I understand it, Willpower helps to dispel the effect for one turn.<br /> 2) There is no mention of this in the V20, DAV20 and Clanbook: Giovanni. It is known that some people may not sleep. Those people who are sleeping will fall asleep, those who have woken up or do not feel tired / sleepy will stay awake. In older editions, it was written that supernatural beings were not affected by the ritual. Personally, I'm still not clear on what is supernatural? Ghoul? Sorcerer? Descendants of fairies and werewolves? I'm just not sure that sorcerers, kinfolks or kinains are supernatural.<br /> <br /> Personally, I use &quot;hybrid rules&quot; because in V20 some abilities don't have a clear description or look too &quot;weak&quot;. Let's say &quot;Gift of Life&quot; in V20 limits the vampire's powers (while ghouls have no problem using disciplines and daylight doesn't block them), however this was fixed in DAV.<br /> If you want to give people the opportunity to resist this ritual - let them roll stamina in normal situations (difficulty depends on fatigue) or willpower (whichever is less) if they have reasons to consciously resist sleep.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25408,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25408-alphari","user":"Alphari","date":". 07-22-2020, 07:14 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25408-alphari","name":"Alphari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25408_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"153"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}